{"title":"D-졸업","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=XeqRY/hAdNST4RrD/QeMCRkPzrkOFHqnVaCAsS1&filename=th3","synopsis":"고백을 하는 것도, 받는 것도 남자?!\n졸업까지 D-92, 간질간질한 소년들의 로맨스가 시작된다. \n\n졸업을 앞둔 어느 날, 무영은 같은 반 남학생 찬희에게 고백을 받는다. 고백해 온 상대는 흉흉한 소문을 몰고 다니는 수수께끼의 전학생 백찬희. \n학생회장에 우등생으로 성실하기만한 무영은 생각지도 못한 상대의 고백에 일단 거절을 한다. 하지만 찬희는 이제부터는 자신을 ‘그런 식’으로 생각해달라며 적극적으로 무영에게 다가가는데….","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":256,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":300,"change":{"type":"down","amount":44}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":231,"change":{"type":"up","amount":69}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":253,"change":{"type":"down","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":247,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":240,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":275,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":260,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":214,"change":{"type":"up","amount":46}},{"date":"2026-09-11","rank":291,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-12","rank":188,"change":{"type":"up","amount":103}},{"date":"2026-09-16","rank":273,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-17","rank":231,"change":{"type":"up","amount":42}},{"date":"2026-09-19","rank":293,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-20","rank":192,"change":{"type":"up","amount":101}},{"date":"2026-09-26","rank":284,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-27","rank":269,"change":{"type":"up","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-09-28","rank":237,"change":{"type":"up","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-09-29","rank":243,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-10-01","rank":227,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-08","rank":285,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-09","rank":226,"change":{"type":"up","amount":59}},{"date":"2026-10-1